---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Homelab Architecture & Services" currentPage="homelab">
  <header class="mb-8 sm:mb-10">
    <div class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 mb-3 bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-800/60 font-mono text-xs text-emerald-400 rounded">
      ❯ INFRASTRUCTURE // SELF_HOSTED
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3 text-white leading-tight font-mono">
      Homelab Architecture & Services
    </h1>
    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
      Self-hosted virtualization, containerized microservices, federated identity, and hardened network isolation.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="space-y-8 sm:space-y-10">
    <!-- Virtualization Core -->
    <section class="p-5 sm:p-6 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl card-hover">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-4">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 font-mono">
          Virtualization Core & Edge Ingress
        </h2>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono font-semibold bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-800/50">
          Proxmox VE
        </span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-slate-950 p-3 sm:p-4 rounded-lg font-mono text-xs text-slate-300 border border-slate-800 overflow-x-auto mb-4 whitespace-nowrap">
        Internet ──&gt; Cloudflare Zero Trust (WAF/Tunnel) ──&gt; Proxmox LXC ──&gt; Nginx (127.0.0.1:8080)
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Public ingress is decoupled from router forwarding using an encrypted, outbound-only Cloudflare Tunnel (<code class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-xs">cloudflared</code>). Traffic terminates at an unprivileged Debian LXC container on Proxmox VE, with host-level firewall policies blocking lateral movement to internal subnets.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-xs font-mono rounded text-slate-300 border border-slate-700">Proxmox VE</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-xs font-mono rounded text-slate-300 border border-slate-700">Cloudflare Tunnel</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-xs font-mono rounded text-slate-300 border border-slate-700">Unprivileged LXC</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-xs font-mono rounded text-slate-300 border border-slate-700">Tailscale Mesh</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Services Grid -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 font-mono">Self-Hosted Services & Workloads</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-5">
        Production microservices managed via container runtimes, integrated behind reverse proxies and federated single sign-on:
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg card-hover">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-white text-base font-mono">Authentik</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400">Identity / IAM</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Single Sign-On (SSO), multi-factor authentication (MFA), and OAuth2/OIDC proxy boundaries across self-hosted web interfaces.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Uptime Kuma Card with Direct Link -->
        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg card-hover flex flex-col justify-between group">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
              <span class="font-bold text-white text-base font-mono flex items-center gap-1.5">
                Uptime Kuma
                <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400">Monitoring / SLA</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Automated continuous health tracking for HTTP endpoints, DNS latency, and container uptime.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a 
            href="https://status.mvoorhies.com" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 inline-flex items-center gap-1 self-start"
          >
            <span>View Live Status Dashboard</span>
            <span>↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg card-hover">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-white text-base font-mono">Nextcloud</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-blue-400">Productivity</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Encrypted file synchronization, document collaboration, and WebDAV endpoints across workstations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg card-hover">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-white text-base font-mono">Immich</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-purple-400">Media Pipeline</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Self-hosted photo/video backup utilizing machine learning pipelines for facial recognition and vector indexing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg card-hover">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-white text-base font-mono">Gitea</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400">DevOps & Git</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Lightweight Git version control hosting configuration playbooks, scripts, and deployment hooks.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg card-hover">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-white text-base font-mono">Portainer</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-sky-400">Containers</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Container stack lifecycle management, Docker compose deployments, and persistent volume tracking.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg sm:col-span-2 card-hover">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-white text-base font-mono">Karakeep</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-rose-400">Preservation</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Dedicated database-backed media and collection preservation system maintaining resilient local archival stores.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Dedicated Hardware -->
    <section class="p-5 sm:p-6 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl card-hover">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white font-mono">DNS Sinkhole & Detection Node</h2>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono font-semibold bg-red-950 text-red-400 border border-red-800/50">
          Hardware: Pi 5 (8GB)
        </span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Core network services and telemetry experiments run on dedicated physical hardware decoupled from the primary virtualization host:
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs font-mono">
        <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 bg-slate-950 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold block mb-1">Pi-hole DNS Sinkhole</span>
          <p class="text-slate-400 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Network-wide recursive DNS filtering blocking ad-trackers, malware domains, and telemetry beaconing across devices.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 bg-slate-950 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold block mb-1">Blue-Team Workbench</span>
          <p class="text-slate-400 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Equipped with Linux kernel auditing (<code class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">auditd</code>) and Suricata NIDS for standalone network inspection.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
